3. Colour values of the dye palettes (#683). The forty-two palettes of the groups House dyes (27) and Outfit dyes (15) in
   assets/palettes.css are made from the four armour-dye colours that the community wiki for the game publishes for each swatch:

   - groups House dyes and Outfit dyes: https://awakening.wiki/Module:Swatches/data (the data module), listed on
     https://awakening.wiki/Swatches. Taken on 2026-11-15: only the colour values (four hex codes for each of the 42 swatches) and the
     swatch names.

   The colours are facts about how the game looks. No text, table layout, image or code of the wiki is copied into the module. The wiki
   states that its content is available under Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike 4.0 unless otherwise noted; that
   licence covers the wiki's own text and presentation, which this module does not use, and it is named here so that the source is
   credited. The palettes are derived by the rules of palettes_dyes_test.go (the darkest dye becomes the page, the most vivid light dyes
   become the accents, every text colour is moved until the contrast checks hold), so the values are this module's own work after the
   dye colours. Each source page is recorded for each palette group here and in PROVENANCE.md.
